Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 18:04:05 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] ggml: add GGML_TYPE_E8_2 E8 lattice 2-bit KV (upstream
 #25352)

Type id 43 (upstream used 42; that is Q2_0 on this pin). Metal adds
dequant/quantize, cpy, get_rows, set_rows, and FA kernels for usable KV.
